<title>JAPAN: Moody's assigns A1 rating to Citicorp samurais.</title>
<headline>Moody's assigns A1 rating to Citicorp samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Friday that it had assigned its A1 rating to Citicorp's 25 billion yen worth of yen/dollar dual-currency samurai bonds due April 2000.</p>
<p>It has also assigned a prospective rating of (P)A1 to Citicorp's 30 billion yen Japanese domestic shelf registration, Moody's said in a statement.</p>
</text>
